title: Leadership table
new-page: true
is-hand: true
max-cards: 3
call: poland_normalize
on-arrival: {!
Q.deckDescription =
    Q.left_in_government
        ? "Party and government affairs"
        : "Party affairs and opposition negotiations";
Q.handDescription = "Cards in hand";
if (Q.advisor_action_timer <= 0) {
    Q.pinnedCardsDescription =
        "Leadership bureau — an advisor intervention is available.";
} else if (Q.advisor_action_timer == 1) {
    Q.pinnedCardsDescription =
        "Leadership bureau — next advisor intervention in 1 month.";
} else {
    Q.pinnedCardsDescription =
        "Leadership bureau — next advisor intervention in " +
        Q.advisor_action_timer + " months.";
}
if (Q.leadership_reshuffle_timer <= 0) {
    Q.pinnedCardsDescription += " A bureau reshuffle is available.";
} else {
    Q.pinnedCardsDescription += " Next reshuffle in " +
        Q.leadership_reshuffle_timer + " months.";
}
!}

= [+ date_label +] — the leadership table

**[+ news_headline +]**

**Government:** [+ government_name +], led by **[+ prime_minister +]**.  
**President:** [+ president_name +].  
**Lewica:** [+ left_role +].

<span class="party party-lewica">**Lewica**</span> has **[+ resources +]
party resources**. Annual income: **[+ party_income +]**.
Membership dues provide **[+ member_dues +]**; the **[+
seat_subvention +]** subvention follows **[+ seat_subvention_seats +]** seats
won at the last Sejm election. [? if emergency_fundraising_timer > 0:
Emergency appeals are locked for **[+ emergency_fundraising_timer +]
months**.?]

[? if left_in_government: The governing settlement has
**[+ budget +] budget capacity** under **[+ budget_authority +]**. ?]

[? if not left_in_government and government_has_confidence and not caretaker_government:
**Government negotiation:** leverage **[+ negotiation_leverage +]/100** ·
crisis pressure **[+ national_crisis_pressure +]/100** · cabinet hostility
**[+ government_negotiation_hostility +]/100**. [+ negotiation_forecast +]. ?]

[? if president_name = "Rafał Trzaskowski" and government_party = "pis":
**Hostile cohabitation:** [+ pis_cohabitation_state +] (internal stress
[+ pis_cohabitation_stress +] · defensive rally [+ pis_cohabitation_rally +]).
?]

Draw up to three cards. Playing one turns the month; discarding one does not.
Choice subtitles state the direct cost, test or main political exchange before
you commit.

- @poland_party_deck
- @poland_government_deck
- @poland_negotiation_deck
- #poland_advisor
- @poland_manage_advisors
- @poland_discard_card

@end_month
title: End month
subtitle: Pass without playing an agenda card. Neglect carries a political cost.
is-pinned-card: true
view-if: started = 1
card-image: img/poland/end_month.svg
go-to: poland_advance

@dossier
title: Polish dossier
subtitle: Rules, factions and institutions.
is-pinned-card: true
is-special: true
view-if: started = 1
card-image: img/poland/dossier.svg
go-to: library
